ar (2.5-3.5, 6.0) TBD\n- light cabinet right wall\n## obs_0011 pose(0,2.25) h=0\n- floor_lamp (-2.32,5.73) CONF\n- stool_round_brown (-0.89,5.45) CONF\n- gray_sofa_L large: corners ~(1.9,6.5) and (3.5,5.9); center ~(2.7,6.2)\n- back wall y~7.6\n## obs_0012 pose(0.65,2.63) h=60\n- cabinet_light (white top, wood front): base near corner ~(2.0,4.0), far ~(3.6,4.4). center ~(2.8,4.2)\n- gray sofa at left (2.7,6.2) consistent\n- potted_plant large foreground (1.2,2.75) CONF\n- dark brown table right edge ~(2.3,1.2)? need check\n## obs_0013 pose(0.65,2.63) h=100\n- table_dark_wood legs -> center ~ (2.5,1.6) size ~1.3x1.3\n- cabinet_light left (2.8,4.2)\n## obs_0014 pose(0.65,2.63) h=170 - SE area empty; long dark table (bench?) at left edge = same table (2.5,1.6)? Actually thin -> may be separate bench. Mark as table_dark.\n## obs_0015 pose(-0.09,2.50) h=80\n- dark table front legs -> (2.68,2.13),(2.81,0.88); center ~(2.6,1.5)\n- cabinet_light near corner (1.96,3.34); center ~(2.6,4.0)\n- plant (1.2,2.75), gray sofa far left\n## obs_0016 pose(-0.09,2.50) h=350: lamp (-2.39,5.79) CONF, stool (-0.92,5.36) CONF\n## obs_0017 pose(-0.09,2.50) h=280: blue_vase (-2.46,1.52); wooden_chair (-2.59,3.64) CONF chair w/ backrest\n## SEGMENT 2 start\nPose track: f18 pose(-0.83,2.63) h=280; f19 h=220; f20 h=310 pose(-1.29,3.01)\nReprojection check obs_0020 lamp -> (-2.45,5.91) vs est (-2.39,5.79) OK. Pose tracking trusted.\nPLAN seg2: go north, confirm stool/lamp, then east along back wall to resolve gray sofa + NE corner.\n## obs_0021 pose(-1.29,3.76) h=0"}]},"8ae1a16551c07c17d2b468bdc7a70acab77c9ad484b805d7f805f2149292bbfa":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm at frame 96 with the next checkpoint at 100, so 4 frames remain. Let me check the tail of notes.md for my current object list and pose state.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Kz9oQjMuScdbHHeg5Dfaq3","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"tail -75 notes.md && echo \"=== current map.jso